## On the job {.unnumbered}

::: callout-important
## Why this matters day to day

Most People Analytics questions are group comparisons with other
factors to control for. Reporting the **size** of a difference with a
credible interval — and justifying your model choice with **LOO**
rather than "I added everything I had" — is exactly the rigour a
sceptical stakeholder should expect, and far more informative than a
table of p-values.
:::

